* The shift identity (Lean gaussSum_mulShift_eq; LargeSieve char_twisted_sum_eq): the Gauss sum with the additive character shifted by a unit U is the inverse character at U times the Gauss sum.

s1::simp1 |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) /\ U e. ZZ /\ ( U gcd N ) = 1 ) -> ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) )
