s5:s2,s3,i4:syl2anc |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) /\ U e. ZZ /\ ( U gcd N ) = 1 ) -> sum_ a e. ( 0 ..^ N ) ( ( X ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` a ) ) x. ( exp ` ( ( 2 x. ( _i x. _pi ) ) x. ( ( U x. a ) / N ) ) ) ) = sum_ a e. ( 0 ..^ N ) ( ( X ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` a ) ) x. ( ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / N ) ) ^ ( U x. a ) ) ) )
s6::dchrgsshiftr |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) /\ U e. ZZ /\ ( U gcd N ) = 1 ) -> sum_ a e. ( 0 ..^ N ) ( ( X ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` a ) ) x. ( ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / N ) ) ^ ( U x. a ) ) ) = ( ( ( ( invg ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ` X ) ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` U ) ) x. ( N DChrGS X ) ) )
qed:s5,s6:eqtrd |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) /\ U e. ZZ /\ ( U gcd N ) = 1 ) -> sum_ a e. ( 0 ..^ N ) ( ( X ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` a ) ) x. ( exp ` ( ( 2 x. ( _i x. _pi ) ) x. ( ( U x. a ) / N ) ) ) ) = ( ( ( ( invg ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ` X ) ` ( ( ZRHom ` ( Z/nZ ` N ) ) ` U ) ) x. ( N DChrGS X ) ) )
